        "what": "`AI/solana-mcp/index.ts` (line 217): the `getTransaction` tool asks for `maxSupportedTransactionVersion: 0`. For a version 1 signature the RPC returns error -32015, and the tool answers the agent with an error (under the label \"Error while getting balance\", line 276, which looks like a copy-paste slip) instead of the transaction.\n\nVersion 1 transactions are a large share of mainnet now (127 of 288 non-vote transactions, about 44%, in a block I sampled today), so this depends only on which wallet or SDK built the transaction.",
