        "fix": "`maxSupportedTransactionVersion: 1` (the `json` shape is the same). On `@solana/kit` ^2.x the TypeScript type only allows `0`; current kit (8.x) allows `1`, so it needs the bump too. Since people copy this example into their own MCP servers, it may be worth fixing here first."
